    {
      "id": "phase-0-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "We're starting here on Earth. Tap the launch button, and let's go to space together!",
      "file": "en/phase-0-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "b00a0ace6d7d1ebc729333ecd01bbdd970cc225788ad76b9549c4b5b55ab5b72",
      "audioHash": "b2202bf55ac7c97efba3111dfca21a87f3aaa5c46e2c99b3fad1ae65afde6030",
      "duration": 6.192,
      "bytes": 37152
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-0-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Our little rocket is ready. Let's get set for space!",
      "file": "en/phase-0-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "acf0b8731ae0d03f369fbc05b8f58d580ad2e532c458f9fcb4745c3d84cac0d6",
      "audioHash": "2013a516fde849affd8fd3b3c9dcf39c4e67a642d5d747fe5f1f712b45553c1a",
      "duration": 4.92,
      "bytes": 29520
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-1-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Everything is checked and ready. Let's count together: three, two, one!",
      "file": "en/phase-1-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "d7e5a48628465865aa80b2ef258084727800de5c2971630d39e294f230b956cd",
      "audioHash": "43ec0c1b95e8a9364a6d3068b4479d5bab0be941fab73631e50da71387f0c4cc",
      "duration": 6.528,
      "bytes": 39168
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-1-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Three, two, one... off we go!",
      "file": "en/phase-1-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "7624ccaa7e1ef5efa7ac1141554547b46c83202fa7640ef9d5eb3bdd0c315695",
      "audioHash": "1bf541894be895ce91c1fa31ab425dc868485969c001e20b36054745ef05cbfb",
      "duration": 3.624,
      "bytes": 21744
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-2-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "The rocket pushes gas down, and the gas pushes the rocket up. Up past the clouds we go, higher and higher!",
      "file": "en/phase-2-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "01c7498403ce2ca33a7a40189d4034f30e6486108c081648dce5c594a97c2212",
      "audioHash": "e15070a54871bc02fdd3bde258a8fba7e988a6e6a8cd745bc623eb58cc6e6d5e",
      "duration": 8.328,
      "bytes": 49968
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-2-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Whoosh! Our rocket is lifting off, up above the clouds!",
      "file": "en/phase-2-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "05d3d4964eb161bf9864ee480b4cbb32dd51af921481d4e8880827298dca85f9",
      "audioHash": "ec0adfbb4129de154cb2f2e6b279ec347c164da4e75ef2169f1f2dc97bb9c97a",
      "duration": 5.184,
      "bytes": 31104
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-3-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "The rocket slowly turns. It keeps climbing and goes faster forward, too. To go around Earth, we need more than just flying up!",
      "file": "en/phase-3-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "bad1b5730e03a32a32cfdcc75e390dff62c30736794d666fc817293c8a997f8f",
      "audioHash": "f0a0320f3a3cce1f4f66cccc84d97bf476f0b764f0b1ab2d907bfdb9459affe9",
      "duration": 10.272,
      "bytes": 61632
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-3-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Up we go, and forward too! Let's make a turn!",
      "file": "en/phase-3-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "052c584749d0dac601babd3c6c695d030faa1941b4a69218df10c745fee166a9",
      "audioHash": "f5fd68d4a15f0617cc564ea2d026a909bf02d1ec686f6c18c6c40a78bf8f546c",
      "duration": 4.992,
      "bytes": 29952
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-4-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "The bottom part of the rocket has finished its job and comes off. The cover protecting the spacecraft opens and comes off, too. The upper rocket keeps pushing us faster forward.",
      "file": "en/phase-4-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "643fbb6917757b2fbdcce9e109306f859a258327b70c5233f7ca2421390d94ad",
      "audioHash": "c091d631260aa85367111781bed58f8ecdedecf9a10edfc004ee93cfc267ad5f",
      "duration": 12.552,
      "bytes": 75312
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-4-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Thank you, rocket helper! Off you go. Let's keep flying!",
      "file": "en/phase-4-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "c7f364922078f10221b1f1966f69ed345393a70e3769a1e522b02571678f54b4",
      "audioHash": "fdf72f7ae339d7912bfa07ce22c41b52bfb9c57863039a05642b89b141678120",
      "duration": 6.432,
      "bytes": 38592
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-5-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Our spacecraft is moving sideways fast enough now! The engine can turn off. Earth's gravity keeps pulling us, making our path curve around Earth.",
      "file": "en/phase-5-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "476a4641620fbd248785da18b4c046fe0f7ef2a884ad408aef7a22e3ce8ff4e6",
      "audioHash": "b29e2c98e1987bcc0ad4f495b61a31ef9733acb2d110894cbf4267371a7bfbd4",
      "duration": 10.944,
      "bytes": 65664
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-5-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "We're moving sideways fast enough to go all around Earth!",
      "file": "en/phase-5-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "f310b9526c8b35590d316d700459e5ae46fe445c6387ba756314ec617e1c1841",
      "audioHash": "a4937a6777bf56f535ff03d044ece2563e4c60f2ea8b6807d960f6a1ff975034",
      "duration": 4.152,
      "bytes": 24912
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-6-full",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Our spacecraft keeps moving forward, and Earth keeps pulling it with gravity. Together, these make it go around Earth. Earth still pulls on us in space!",
      "file": "en/phase-6-full.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "e1b4c4c0a8b910cbaa9569e997384fc124d1063b261bd670649abee8eba7048f",
      "audioHash": "88d342039c87830111f6d45e24a212b70e62c084fa3201959899f89cd415f86b",
      "duration": 11.232,
      "bytes": 67392
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-6-short",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Hello, space! We're flying all the way around our Earth!",
      "file": "en/phase-6-short.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "72ee65d1fe3cf7a5978c152e853aa21cb929bddced6fc964d378c38609916bca",
      "audioHash": "58fe5e43c792d699e7c701863d495c8c24e0180889803288ac7eae6d6cfc3495",
      "duration": 5.208,
      "bytes": 31248
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-earth",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Earth. I have blue oceans and lots of land. You, your family, and the animals all live here! One trip around the Sun takes a year.",
      "file": "en/planet-earth.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "0d5decc9081fbf2b04daa66ed60ba7a486ec67ef8af0145bf5d26f5b37a070a0",
      "audioHash": "4fdef9228bd67dd3f40ce833d1e3eaf77a381809cc75b681e3a3814871857873",
      "duration": 11.784,
      "bytes": 70704
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-jupiter",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Jupiter, the biggest of the eight planets. My clouds look like stripes, and I have a great big red storm!",
      "file": "en/planet-jupiter.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "5da6cc9758e947a9e18fbd691b8cc5882323f76cd52f4ebe5d5aa3961289fb18",
      "audioHash": "10a103c36ca6b314d0c8f7d5a7b051382a808659f131376b33d9625752e7c14a",
      "duration": 8.136,
      "bytes": 48816
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-mars",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Mars, Earth's neighbor. I'm covered in reddish dust. Little robot rovers are exploring here!",
      "file": "en/planet-mars.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "d42ce5f9270f4a343e8fdf0d635f31b3b50492c289c7908c5e8585a96a3911fa",
      "audioHash": "9e32065596182f765692caaa59d0ae31932071cd316f727f39a0e560e824c8cb",
      "duration": 8.232,
      "bytes": 49392
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-mercury",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Mercury, a little planet. I live closest to the Sun, and I go around it very quickly!",
      "file": "en/planet-mercury.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "bea1bd33d2779d5193e85a167901ff7ff27b515427ef7ba86b6066e55dc53b02",
      "audioHash": "40848bb8db4a1927b0157a16d42a8f12709f182fefa73a547ef27acf09697f78",
      "duration": 7.344,
      "bytes": 44064
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-neptune",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Neptune, a blue planet. Of the eight planets, I'm farthest from the Sun. It's very cold here, with very strong winds!",
      "file": "en/planet-neptune.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "192f4259509b21f42763768e782eddaf81b7f4d03c79267d514bcfe3d22e6096",
      "audioHash": "9c73efd00e47ae12c250c724b31f73a9fa88f3fc18b71e4f19e83e5cac6335bf",
      "duration": 10.2,
      "bytes": 61200
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-saturn",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Saturn. My pretty rings look like hula hoops! They're made of lots and lots of little pieces of ice and rock.",
      "file": "en/planet-saturn.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "2113bdbd89fdb8c6d63029334db417c0b74ea216d59fdd036962e16be8387889",
      "audioHash": "be36e76905848780f77d28a5de20159bcd6f64d2bcda31995df2302a6d4a64d4",
      "duration": 9.048,
      "bytes": 54288
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-sun",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm the Sun. I make my own light and warmth! I'm a star, not a planet. All eight planets go around me.",
      "file": "en/planet-sun.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "f1869e450479c7fe3092ff1d405aa1787c359b6745e964b9c3b774674f4fdc0f",
      "audioHash": "1ae0efbc6f4fd6f15a4c0565d354768b7deea124f36ae7e86041953eeb3afbd4",
      "duration": 9.936,
      "bytes": 59616
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-uranus",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Uranus, a pale blue-green planet. I'm tipped way over when I spin, like a ball rolling on its side!",
      "file": "en/planet-uranus.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "c90486450beaab4114d620f5b1380041589ba17d55f2eb02f0a0b23b89b55341",
      "audioHash": "918261f7d208948f30bd9b560142184d3ac5f44bf264199d454e672a678399c5",
      "duration": 7.872,
      "bytes": 47232
    },
    {
      "id": "planet-venus",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "I'm Venus. My thick clouds look like a big coat! I'm the hottest planet in our solar system. Let's wave from far away!",
      "file": "en/planet-venus.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "d6e4b420a79cd3bac12076b3e2283329b72612091d31f81a9bb1e866bf648896",
      "audioHash": "b1d13b0545544d8478484c4032706cee0977b4864d752147a3c437ede2f42774",
      "duration": 10.464,
      "bytes": 62784
    },
    {
      "id": "preview",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Hello, little astronaut! I am here to explore space with you. Shall we meet the planets and take a little rocket ride together?",
      "file": "en/preview.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "909a5ab15762897ff4f8e36440261db8bb386c65d4c9b7176bfc6bef2dfce382",
      "audioHash": "173fccd6e0ab7fc1273a532997bc7b4eb02495abcd55846275d8bdf2c331e607",
      "duration": 9.672,
      "bytes": 58032
    },
    {
      "id": "quiz-earth",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Can you find the planet we call home?",
      "file": "en/quiz-earth.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "adcf98ecf4796f740df6bbe4aded2489d608631099466378fe85a3a78c8fdf1a",
      "audioHash": "b0522886db320efa8b2014e6b39900ab21952e8c931d747390f330c6a4be518a",
      "duration": 2.784,
      "bytes": 16704
    },
    {
      "id": "quiz-jupiter",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Can you find the biggest planet?",
      "file": "en/quiz-jupiter.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "10989706550028178838f4016df653d0871690585bd8853c2606ca65253d9e06",
      "audioHash": "2e54689688b30a2e7a5f200f84af0b2d07c1e2d623943458d47576636a3b650c",
      "duration": 2.568,
      "bytes": 15408
    },
    {
      "id": "quiz-mars",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Can you find our dusty red neighbor?",
      "file": "en/quiz-mars.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "3b6095aaf82d1a24deffd41cb0673adb979eb7b5bfac3e17779fd8990389598e",
      "audioHash": "b9e9f900416feba50be3e93f7b6a56f796a598fbc2543b6a9e78cbc827238d90",
      "duration": 2.736,
      "bytes": 16416
    },
    {
      "id": "quiz-mercury",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Can you find the planet closest to the Sun?",
      "file": "en/quiz-mercury.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "sourceHash": "4ff708c6f233f533791bc28a459fcf27152080190a0c7cde9a1f820498f80e11",
      "audioHash": "85622d6f81161c5d81dd4c20e2083c2a88abb3c61eebaf7b52461eb60d109594",
      "duration": 3.168,
      "bytes": 19008
    },
    {
      "id": "quiz-neptune",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Can you find the planet farthest from the Sun?",
      "file": "en/quiz-neptune.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
      "rate": "-5%",
